################################################################################################

== tree /etc/systemd/network
D .
F ./br0.netdev: keep br0.netdev|
F ./br0.network: keep br0.network|
F ./dummy0.netdev: keep dummy0.netdev|
F ./dummy0.network: keep dummy0.network|
F ./eth0.network: keep eth0.network|
F ./eth1.network: keep eth1.network|
F ./usb0.network: keep usb0.network|
